{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/1187.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！今日わミナミと一緒に原宿行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日朝から仕事で疲れたと思うのに、一緒に原宿行ってくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミナミありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0238.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/1mhvz5_70.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね！原宿に向かってる途中で！横断歩道をわたってたんですよ！そしたら隣からいっぱい車が私たちに向かって走ってくるんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0366.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしたちわちゃん青信号でわたったんですよ！そしてもう一回信号を見たら青だったんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0366.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、車の方の信号も青なんですよ！なんで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0074.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っておもいますよねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0174.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまた、信号をみたらですねぇ、あたしたちがわたる信号機わ赤だったんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0366.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ太陽の光で反射して青信号にみえてたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0366.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"wwwwほんとひかれる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っておもいましたよぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"wwww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねぇミナミ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"死ぬかとおもったよねぇ？w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぅホントにハプニングでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/810419.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日わハプニングばっかりだったんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/1141.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミナミが何回も転んだりして"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/27277_0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"wwwwwwww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもめっちゃくちゃ楽しかったですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0228.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして無事に原宿ついて、マックに行ったり、色んな服屋さんにいったりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてリズリサに行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃかわいい服があって、ミナミと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『お店ごと買いたいねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とお話しながらワイワイしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたらもぅ辺りわ薄暗くて…………(∋_∈)二人で過ごす時間わあっという間でしたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0048.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっとミナミと遊びたかったケド、ミナミもあたしもはやく帰んなきゃいけないから、東京駅まで一緒に帰って、それからバイバイしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0125.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミナミとバイバイしたあとわちょっぴり心細くて寂しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/27277_0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0342.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイバイしたあとわお互いMailしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミナミありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/1024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒にあそぼうねっ？ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん♪こんな1日でしたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/8119.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃぁここらへんでバイビー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/0457.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}